    "sub_name": "金融倫理",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL ETHICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹倫理準則、金融產業的醜聞案例、金融從業人員的合宜行為、以及金融業務可能涉及的利益衝突等重要議題。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces important issues on human ethics, scandals in financial industry, appropriate conducts of financial profession, and conflicts of interest in financial services.",
